      :retained
      "Actual external billing/account limits and concrete provider policy remain applicable to actual paid/provider operations. Retain observed cost/token facts only where they record external provider use or a separately required audit fact, without an internal admission/debit obligation.",
      :independent-semantics
      "Keep profile/type/effect/capability legality, exact schema and sink validation, prompt/taint/secret policy, required human review, provider identity/substitution policy, replay barriers, retention/deletion and semantic failure/cancellation/retry/idempotency/compensation behavior. Actual host timeout/watchdog/heap/capture/platform restrictions are separate.",
      :mixed-diagnostics
